{
  "uid": "ccu4-overview",
  "title": "CCU4 · Estado general de la cafetería",
  "tags": ["ccu4", "sre", "cafeteria"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "editable": false,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "endpoint",
        "label": "Endpoint sondeado",
        "type": "query",
        "query": "label_values(cafeteria_probe_up, endpoint)",
        "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus-ccu4"},
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "sort": 1,
        "refresh": 1,
        "current": {"selected": true, "text": "All", "value": "$__all"}
      },
      {
        "name": "container",
        "label": "Contenedor",
        "type": "query",
        "query": "label_values(cafeteria_container_running, name)",
        "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus-ccu4"},
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "sort": 1,
        "refresh": 1,
        "current": {"selected": true, "text": "All", "value": "$__all"}
      },
      {
        "name": "job",
        "label": "Job de Prometheus",
        "type": "query",
        "query": "label_values(up, job)",
        "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus-ccu4"},
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "sort": 1,
        "refresh": 1,
        "current": {"selected": true, "text": "All", "value": "$__all"}
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Disponibilidad de /health (ventana 5 min)",
      "description": "Porcentaje de sondas exitosas sobre el endpoint de salud real de la API.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 0},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus-ccu4"},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "avg_over_time(cafeteria_probe_up{endpoint=\"health\"}[5m]) * 100", "legendFormat": "Disponibilidad"}],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "decimals": 1,
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "thresholds": {"mode": "absolute", "steps": [{"color": "red", "value": null}, {"color": "orange", "value": 90}, {"color": "green", "value": 99}]}
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {"reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false}, "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "area", "textMode": "auto"}
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Sondas por segundo",
      "description": "Tasa de peticiones generadas por el exportador de sondas; no es el tráfico real de clientes.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 0},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus-ccu4"},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "sum(rate(cafeteria_probe_requests_total[$__rate_interval]))", "legendFormat": "sondas/s"}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "reqps", "decimals": 2}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false}, "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "area", "textMode": "auto"}
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Tasa de errores de sonda",
      "description": "Sondas fallidas por red o código HTTP >= 400.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 0},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus-ccu4"},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "sum(rate(cafeteria_probe_errors_total[$__rate_interval]))", "legendFormat": "errores/s"}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "reqps", "decimals": 2, "thresholds": {"mode": "absolute", "steps": [{"color": "green", "value": null}, {"color": "red", "value": 0.1}]}}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false}, "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "area", "textMode": "auto"}
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Contenedores en ejecución",
      "description": "Contenedores observados por Docker Engine en el stack local.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 0},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus-ccu4"},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "count(cafeteria_container_running == 1)", "legendFormat": "activos"}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short", "decimals": 0}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false}, "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "none", "textMode": "auto"}
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latencia de sondas: promedio y p95",
      "description": "Latencia medida por el exportador hacia /health y /menu. No sustituye la latencia real de clientes.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 5},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus-ccu4"},
      "targets": [
        {"refId": "A", "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, endpoint) (rate(cafeteria_probe_duration_seconds_bucket{endpoint=~\"$endpoint\"}[$__rate_interval])))", "legendFormat": "p95 {{endpoint}}"},
        {"refId": "B", "expr": "sum by (endpoint) (rate(cafeteria_probe_duration_seconds_sum{endpoint=~\"$endpoint\"}[$__rate_interval])) / clamp_min(sum by (endpoint) (rate(cafeteria_probe_duration_seconds_count{endpoint=~\"$endpoint\"}[$__rate_interval])), 0.001)", "legendFormat": "promedio {{endpoint}}"}
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 3,
          "custom": {"drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10, "lineWidth": 2, "showPoints": "never", "spanNulls": false, "stacking": {"mode": "none"}}
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true}, "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}}
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Tráfico de sondas por endpoint",
      "description": "Solicitudes por segundo generadas por las sondas del exportador.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 5},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus-ccu4"},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "sum by (endpoint) (rate(cafeteria_probe_requests_total{endpoint=~\"$endpoint\"}[$__rate_interval]))", "legendFormat": "{{endpoint}}"}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "reqps", "decimals": 2, "custom": {"drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 15, "lineWidth": 2, "showPoints": "never", "stacking": {"mode": "none"}}}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true}, "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}}
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Tasa de errores HTTP de sondas",
      "description": "Fracción de sondas fallidas por endpoint en ventana móvil.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 13},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus-ccu4"},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "sum by (endpoint) (rate(cafeteria_probe_errors_total{endpoint=~\"$endpoint\"}[$__rate_interval])) / clamp_min(sum by (endpoint) (rate(cafeteria_probe_requests_total{endpoint=~\"$endpoint\"}[$__rate_interval])), 0.001)", "legendFormat": "{{endpoint}}"}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "percentunit", "decimals": 3, "min": 0, "max": 1, "custom": {"drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10, "lineWidth": 2, "showPoints": "never"}}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true}, "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}}
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Estado actual de los endpoints",
      "description": "Valor instantáneo de la última sonda por endpoint.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 13},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus-ccu4"},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "cafeteria_probe_up{endpoint=~\"$endpoint\"}", "legendFormat": "{{endpoint}}", "format": "table", "instant": true}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short", "decimals": 0, "custom": {"align": "auto", "cellOptions": {"type": "auto"}}}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"showHeader": true, "cellHeight": "sm"}
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "CPU por contenedor (núcleos)",
      "description": "Tasa de segundos de CPU por contenedor, obtenida de Docker Engine.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 21},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus-ccu4"},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "sum by (name) (rate(cafeteria_container_cpu_seconds_total{name=~\"$container\"}[$__rate_interval]))", "legendFormat": "{{name}}"}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "none", "decimals": 3, "min": 0, "custom": {"drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10, "lineWidth": 2, "showPoints": "never"}}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true}, "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}}
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Memoria por contenedor",
      "description": "Memoria en uso reportada por Docker Engine.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 21},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus-ccu4"},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "cafeteria_container_memory_bytes{name=~\"$container\"}", "legendFormat": "{{name}}"}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "bytes", "decimals": 1, "min": 0, "custom": {"drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10, "lineWidth": 2, "showPoints": "never"}}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true}, "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}}
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Targets de Prometheus",
      "description": "Disponibilidad de los jobs configurados, incluyendo los archivos targets.d cuando tengan destinos.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 29},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus-ccu4"},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "up{job=~\"$job\"}", "legendFormat": "{{job}} · {{instance}}"}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short", "decimals": 0, "min": 0, "max": 1, "custom": {"drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 5, "lineWidth": 2, "showPoints": "never"}}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true}, "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}}
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Integraciones pendientes: escalamiento, proxy y AWS",
      "description": "Estado honesto de las métricas que aún no existen en el repositorio.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 29},
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**No hay métricas ficticias en este dashboard.**\n\n- Eventos de escalamiento: pendiente de que Emilio exponga `/metrics` en el controller y registre su destino en `infra/monitoring/prometheus/targets.d/controller.json`.\n- Métricas del reverse proxy: pendiente de Jesús con el mismo mecanismo en `reverse-proxy.json`.\n- Tráfico local vs AWS y duración de instancias: pendiente de que el controller publique etiquetas de origen; el README exige que las instancias vivan 5–10 minutos.\n- RPS, latencia y errores del tráfico real de clientes: requiere instrumentar la API con `prometheus_client` (cambio en responsabilidad de Carlos, pendiente de autorización). Hoy solo se miden las sondas del exportador.\n\nCuando existan esos endpoints, los paneles se agregan sin modificar la API ni el pipeline."
      }
    }
  ]
}
